# marked copies (P###_marked.pdf) are rebuilt by `mesh.py build` from the originals and the cards, so git does not keep them;
# your own highlights and notes on them travel in sources/*/P*_annotations.json
sources/*/P*_marked.pdf
index/.scratch/
index/.new*.md
# a drop folder for papers and supplementary files waiting to be anchored; the anchored copies live in sources/
ingest/
